=== 5. per-context heterogeneity of the c3 distribution ===
 If some contexts give a systematically better residual distribution, the
 per-context low-bit histograms should differ by more than multinomial noise.
  I(ctx ; c3 mod 2^8) = 0.00635 bits   shuffle null = 0.00040 bits
  I(ctx ; c3 mod 2^10) = 0.16277 bits   shuffle null = 0.14659 bits
  I(ctx ; c3 mod 2^12) = 1.07197 bits   shuffle null = 1.04505 bits
